## The shell history

A command that an agent runs is not an interactive shell command, so it never reaches
the shell history. The history therefore cannot prove that no rule was broken, and this
check does not claim that it does. The proof is the shift log, which lists every
command the night ran, and the module's command list above, which shows there is no
merge, no push and no force push anywhere in the overnight module.
